-- std — Nessa standard library package root (`mod.ns`).
--
-- Submodules are file-based (discovered beside this file):
--   builtin.ns   — builtin type aliases (`.Name'builtin`)
--   prelude.ns   — intended implicit imports
--   io.ns        — print / println / conversions
--   math.ns      — abs, sin, cos, …
--   string.ns    — str_len / str_concat
--   process.ns   — exit / panic
